	//Events
	"CP.Letter.VoidWitch": "Greetings, mortal Farmer,^^It came to my ears that you have been doing many things in the valley.^^While I tend to keep to myself my Familiar, Faust, evinced curiosity in visit your residencial area.^^He shall bring new curiosities for the month of Samhain from my personal repository.^^As above, so below.^^-The Void Witch",
	
